@startuml
title 3.6.21 Reserve an item for one claimant
caption UC-117 | Planned | Proposed design
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor white
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
show footbox
<style>
lifeLine {
    LineStyle 0
}
</style>
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ActorBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    GroupBackgroundColor white
    GroupHeaderBackgroundColor white
}

' Source: docs/requirements/uc.md
' Main entity migration: apps/api-node/src/migrations/002_lost_found_schema.sql
' One-table abstraction: related repository reads/writes stay inside the service.
actor "Finder" as Actor
participant "Proposed Finder Reservation" as Page
participant "Proposed Claims API" as API
participant "Proposed Reservation Service" as Service
participant "claims" as Table <<entity>>

Actor -> Page: 1: Open Reserve an item for one claimant
activate Page
Page -> API: 2: Reserve one accepted claim (proposed interface)
activate API
API -> API: 3: Validate access session, role and input
alt Valid request
API -> Service: 4: Reserve an item for one claimant
activate Service
Service -> Service: 5: Require actual Finder; validated human ownership decision
Service -> Service: 6: Begin transaction; lock item source and all competing claims
Service -> Table: 7: Proposed: record one active claimant reservation
activate Table
Table --> Service: 8: Reservation reference
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 9: Audit explicit reservation; do not mark property RETURNED
Service --> API: 10: Temporary Finder reservation
API --> Page: 11: HTTP 200: Temporary Finder reservation
Page --> Actor: 12: Show authorized result
deactivate Service
else Invalid input, missing session or insufficient role
API --> Page: 4.1: Proposed rejection: invalid input / authorization
Page --> Actor: 4.2: Show appropriate error; retain form/draft
end
deactivate API
deactivate Page

legend left
Scope: Planned: current Staff warehouse reserve API is not Finder reservation. Proposed peer
workflow and schema rules require implementation.
endlegend
@enduml
